ew years and I think  there's great potential that this will  really significantly enhance the  therapies and help the lives of you know  thousands and tens of thousands of  patients and so we certainly look  forward to collaborating and working  with the scientific community and the  cancer community to taking that path  well we'd like to once again thank dr.  Carlock for his presentation I would  also like to thank laberd's for making  today's educational webcast possible and  before we go I want to let everyone know  that today's webcast will be available  for on-demand viewing through January of  2019 you will receive an email from  labradorite um you know when this  webcast will be available for replay pre  share that announcement with your  colleagues who may have missed today's  event that's all for now thank you for  joining us and we hope to see you again  soon goodbye
 

